Package: nocurve
Type: Package
Title: Contextual Empirical Bayes Curve Estimation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Bahadır", "Yüzbaşı", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "bahadir.yuzbasi@inonu.edu.tr",
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6196-3201"))
Description: Implements the noise-orthogonal contextual estimator (NOC)
    for a signal on an equally spaced observation grid using stationary
    wavelet shrinkage. The matched family includes the context-free
    empirical Bayes baseline EB0 and the unprojected contextual estimator
    RAW for assessing the contribution of projection.
